# Checkpoint for the machine where the work happens. Holds LAN addresses, the
# node's Linux user and other details that must never reach this repo.
STATUS.md

# Staging for the drive: manifests from make-manifest.ps1 (snapshot data, about
# 1 MB, already on the drive) plus a copy of node/. Rebuilt before every fill.
seed/to-drive/

# Bundles sent to PyBLOCK, one dated folder each, from tools/make-pyblock-bundle.py.
# Kept on this machine as the exact bytes sent; rebuildable from the repo.
dist/

# Logs from a fill or a bring-up
*.log

# Secrets: the node's RPC settings never belong here
.env
.env.*
bitcoin.conf
settings.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
